r Language: Other. Basic Math is Mathematics: Basic 45+15; Radio Basic is Radio: Basic 45+15; Wilderness Survival 30+10. W.P. Energy Rifle plus two W.P. of choice. Hand to Hand: Basic to Expert for one other skill, Martial Arts or Assassin (if evil) for two. || RELATED: the book prints R.C.C. Related Skills for a race played on its own, so they are granted: eight, plus two at levels 3 and 7 and one at 10 and 12. Every category Any: Communications, Domestic, Pilot, Pilot Related and Wilderness +5, Technical +10. Medical prints +5% on Paramedic or First Aid only; a category bonus applies to every pick, so no bonus is stored and the +5 is a note. Horsemanship is granted because the catalog files riding under its own category and Pilot is Any (the flying-tiger precedent). Secondary: six, same list without bonuses. || EQUIPMENT: Equalizer combat shotgun or ''light striker laser rifle'' - no weapon of that name is described anywhere in the book (it appears only in the four Achilles mutant equipment lines), so the choice pairs the equalizer-combat-shotgun with the lightbringer-laser-rifle, the Achilles laser rifle the book does describe (judgement). Energy sidearm of choice: a choice led by the ip-7-ion-pistol, issued to Achilles militia. Four reloads/E-clips for each weapon: e-clip x4 for the sidearm, the long gun''s four in prose. Customizable combat armor (M.D.C. 75) is the customizable-armor row. Hand radio is walkie-talkie; gas mask, survival kit, bedroll, one week''s rations (food-rations x1) and survival knife are catalog rows. || MONEY: 3D6x100 credits. || Cybernetics: no line printed; nothing stored."
